{"id":"vd-a2-the-blue-bike","level":"a2","n":29,"title":{"en":"What Were You Doing?","vi":"Lúc đó em đang làm gì?"},"summary":"Ở đồn cảnh sát, cô Ruiz hỏi Dev từng chi tiết về lúc chiếc xe đạp biến mất.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-blue-bike","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Blue Bike","vi":"Chiếc xe đạp xanh"}},"scene":{"background":"office","props":[{"id":"notebook","x":800}]},"cast":{"ruiz":{"name":{"en":"Officer Ruiz","vi":"Cảnh sát Ruiz"},"look":"woman","x":540,"style":{"hair":"bun","hairColor":"#2B1B14","skin":"#C98E68","skinShade":"#B07650","outfit":"uniform","top":"#2F4A7A","topShade":"#243B63","hat":"police"}},"dev":{"name":{"en":"Dev","vi":"Dev"},"look":"teenboy","x":1160,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#9C6644","skinShade":"#845436","outfit":"tee","top":"#3FA34D","topShade":"#338A3F"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"ruiz","en":"OK, Dev. Tell me what happened.","vi":"Được rồi, Dev. Kể cho cô nghe chuyện gì đã xảy ra.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","dɛv","tɛl","mi","wʌt","ˈhæpənd"],"start":0.554,"end":2.784,"expression":"neutral","prop":"notebook","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.219],[2,1.695],[3,1.926],[4,2.062],[5,2.238]]},{"speaker":"dev","en":"Someone stole my new bike outside the bookshop.","vi":"Ai đó đã lấy trộm chiếc xe đạp mới của em trước hiệu sách.","ipa":["ˈsʌmˌwʌn","stoʊl","maɪ","nu","baɪk","ˈaʊtˈsaɪd","ðə","ˈbʊkˌʃɑp"],"start":3.574,"end":6.264,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,3.574],[1,3.907],[2,4.273],[3,4.437],[4,4.763],[5,5.157],[6,5.659],[7,5.754]]},{"speaker":"ruiz","en":"What time was it?","vi":"Lúc đó là mấy giờ?","ipa":["wʌt","taɪm","wɑz","ɪt"],"start":7.054,"end":8.064,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,7.054],[1,7.294],[2,7.593],[3,7.797]]},{"speaker":"dev","en":"About half past ten this morning.","vi":"Khoảng mười rưỡi sáng nay ạ.","ipa":["əˈbaʊt","hæf","pæst","tɛn","ðɪs","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ"],"start":8.854,"end":10.754,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,8.854],[1,9.094],[2,9.433],[3,9.814],[4,10.058],[5,10.276]]},{"speaker":"ruiz","en":"And what were you doing at that time?","vi":"Còn lúc đó em đang làm gì?","ipa":["ənd","wʌt","wɝ","ju","ˈduɪŋ","æt","ðæt","taɪm"],"start":11.544,"end":13.324,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,11.544],[1,11.693],[2,11.883],[3,12.005],[4,12.155],[5,12.508],[6,12.617],[7,12.848]]},{"speaker":"dev","en":"I was looking at comics inside the shop.","vi":"Em đang xem truyện tranh trong cửa hàng.","ipa":["aɪ","wɑz","ˈlʊkɪŋ","æt","ˈkɑmɪks","ˌɪnˈsaɪd","ðə","ʃɑp"],"start":14.114,"end":16.424,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,14.114],[1,14.147],[2,14.337],[3,14.677],[4,14.813],[5,15.356],[6,15.859],[7,15.927]]},{"speaker":"ruiz","en":"Was anyone standing near your bike?","vi":"Có ai đứng gần xe của em không?","ipa":["wɑz","ˈɛniˌwʌn","ˈstændɪŋ","nɪɹ","jɔɹ","baɪk"],"start":17.214,"end":19.154,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,17.214],[1,17.427],[2,17.889],[3,18.378],[4,18.596],[5,18.745]]},{"speaker":"dev","en":"Yes. A man was waiting across the street.","vi":"Có ạ. Một người đàn ông đang đứng đợi bên kia đường.","ipa":["jɛs","ə","mæn","wɑz","ˈweɪtɪŋ","əˈkɹɔs","ðə","stɹit"],"start":19.944,"end":22.744,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,19.944],[1,20.622],[2,20.704],[3,21.084],[4,21.329],[5,21.75],[6,22.225],[7,22.32]]},{"speaker":"ruiz","en":"What was he wearing?","vi":"Anh ta mặc gì?","ipa":["wʌt","wɑz","hi","ˈwɛɹɪŋ"],"start":23.534,"end":24.574,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,23.534],[1,23.747],[2,23.924],[3,24.06]]},{"speaker":"dev","en":"He was wearing a grey hoodie and black jeans.","vi":"Anh ta mặc áo hoodie xám và quần bò đen.","ipa":["hi","wɑz","ˈwɛɹɪŋ","ə","ɡɹeɪ","ˈhʊdi","ənd","blæk","dʒinz"],"start":25.364,"end":27.904,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,25.364],[1,25.407],[2,25.584],[3,25.964],[4,26.059],[5,26.385],[6,26.847],[7,27.024],[8,27.35]]},{"speaker":"ruiz","en":"What was he doing?","vi":"Anh ta đang làm gì?","ipa":["wʌt","wɑz","hi","ˈduɪŋ"],"start":28.694,"end":29.644,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,28.694],[1,28.907],[2,29.057],[3,29.179]]},{"speaker":"dev","en":"He was talking on his phone and watching the shop.","vi":"Anh ta đang nói chuyện điện thoại và nhìn về phía cửa hàng.","ipa":["hi","wɑz","ˈtɔkɪŋ","ɑn","hɪz","foʊn","ənd","ˈwɑtʃɪŋ","ðə","ʃɑp"],"start":30.434,"end":33.014,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,30.434],[1,30.487],[2,30.664],[3,31.071],[4,31.18],[5,31.384],[6,31.887],[7,32.077],[8,32.552],[9,32.634]]},{"speaker":"ruiz","en":"Good. That's very helpful. Can you describe your bike?","vi":"Tốt. Thông tin này rất có ích. Em mô tả chiếc xe được không?","ipa":["ɡʊd","ðæts","ˈvɛɹi","ˈhɛlpfəl","kæn","ju","dɪˈskɹaɪb","jɔɹ","baɪk"],"start":33.804,"end":38.844,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,33.804],[1,35.196],[2,35.55],[3,35.862],[4,37.438],[5,37.683],[6,37.805],[7,38.294],[8,38.444]]},{"speaker":"dev","en":"It's blue, and there's a lion sticker under the seat.","vi":"Nó màu xanh, và có một miếng dán hình sư tử dưới yên.","ipa":["ɪts","blu","ənd","ðɛɹz","ə","ˈlaɪən","ˈstɪkɚ","ˈʌndɚ","ðə","sit"],"start":39.634,"end":42.584,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,39.634],[1,39.744],[2,40.491],[3,40.682],[4,40.872],[5,40.967],[6,41.361],[7,41.905],[8,42.149],[9,42.244]]},{"speaker":"ruiz","en":"A lion? That's a very good detail. We'll do our best, Dev.","vi":"Sư tử à? Chi tiết đó rất hay. Chúng tôi sẽ cố hết sức, Dev ạ.","ipa":["ə","ˈlaɪən","ðæts","ə","ˈvɛɹi","ɡʊd","dɪˈteɪl","wil","du","ˈaʊɚ","bɛst","dɛv"],"start":43.374,"end":49.124,"expression":"happy","react":{"dev":"happy"},"timing":[[0,43.374],[1,43.441],[2,44.886],[3,45.212],[4,45.307],[5,45.647],[6,45.891],[7,47.467],[8,47.726],[9,47.902],[10,48.079],[11,48.704]]}],"words":[{"id":"happen","en":"happen","ipa":"ˈhæpən","vi":"xảy ra; diễn ra; tình cờ","level":0},{"id":"comic","en":"comic","ipa":"ˈkɑmɪk","vi":"hài hước; truyện tranh","level":1},{"id":"wear","en":"wear","ipa":"wɛɹ","vi":"mặc, đeo; mòn; đồ mặc","level":0},{"id":"describe","en":"describe","ipa":"dɪˈskɹaɪb","vi":"mô tả; miêu tả","level":0},{"id":"seat","en":"seat","ipa":"sit","vi":"chỗ ngồi; ghế","level":0},{"id":"helpful","en":"helpful","ipa":"ˈhɛlpfəl","vi":"hữu ích; giúp ích","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Kể lại sự việc: thì quá khứ tiếp diễn","pattern":"What were you doing when …? · I was …ing. · Was anyone …ing? · A man was …ing. · What was he wearing?","explain":"Quá khứ tiếp diễn (was/were + V-ing) tả việc ĐANG diễn ra tại một thời điểm trong quá khứ, làm nền cho sự việc chính: \"I was looking at comics when someone stole my bike.\" Hỏi: \"What were you doing?\", \"What was he wearing?\".","keys":["what were you doing","i was","was anyone","was waiting","was he wearing"],"lines":[4,5,6,7,8]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-blue-bike.mp3","v":"8ea39e8f14","duration":50.208,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}